"says only what a stage was given its own error message to say, and the "
"generic \"Authentication failed.\" where none was written. A stage's own "
"error message always takes precedence over this. Note: this is "
"independent of \"hide_specific_error_message\" (in the authentication "
"scope), which never applies to conditional-access wording."
msgstr ""

